1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,770
Two movements do the work.

2
00:00:01,770 --> 00:00:10,546
In epiboly, the small animal cells divide fast and spread down over the yolky cells, like a sock being pulled on.

3
00:00:10,546 --> 00:00:12,109
They become ectoderm.

4
00:00:12,109 --> 00:00:18,411
In emboly, cells roll inwards over the lip of the blastopore and move forward inside.

5
00:00:18,411 --> 00:00:20,989
They become mesoderm and endoderm.

